{
  "abstract": "Lean 4 formalization of the variational estimate, common pointwise limit for von Mangoldt and prime averages, and logarithmic Mobius cancellation in Pointwise Ergodic Theorems Along $\\lfloor p^c\\rfloor$ for Every $c>1$. The author selected the a.e. conclusion for the submitted prime-convergence statement. All results are stated for sigma-finite measure-preserving systems.",
